<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.7.4">
<l>imaiyava riṟumān tiruntara cāḷavēṟ ṟuvante tirporu cēṉai</l>
<l>namapuram naṇuka nāntakam viciṟum nampuru ṭōttamaṉ nakartā</l>
<l>ṉimavantan toṭaṅki yiruṅkaṭa laḷavu mirukarai yulakirait tāṭa</l>
<l>kamaiyuṭaip perumaik kaṅkaiyiṉ karaimēl kaṇṭameṉ ṉuṅkaṭi nakarē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>The city of our Puruṣottama,</l>
<l rend="indent">who weilded Nāndaka to send to Yama’s city</l>
<l>the army that fought, coming en masse, in opposition</l>
<l rend="indent">when the haughty immortals ruled the realm,</l>
<l>is the protected city called Kaṇṭam</l>
<l rend="indent">on the banks of the Ganges of enduring greatness</l>
<l>[where] the [whole] world [comes] to bathe, shouting,</l>
<l rend="indent">on [its] two shores, from the Himalayas to the vast ocean.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
